&nbsp;in&nbsp;English!</p><p dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;If&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;looking&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;house&nbsp;to&nbsp;rent,&nbsp;please&nbsp;contact&nbsp;us!</p><p dir=\"auto\">🍎LINE:&nbsp;Directly&nbsp;search&nbsp;for&nbsp;phone&nbsp;number0955-959-588&nbsp;to&nbsp;join&nbsp;directly!</p><p dir=\"auto\">🍎You&nbsp;can&nbsp;also&nbsp;directly&nbsp;scan&nbsp;the&nbsp;QR&nbsp;code&nbsp;to&nbsp;join!</p><p dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;We&nbsp;can&nbsp;help&nbsp;you&nbsp;to&nbsp;rent&nbsp;a&nbsp;house!</p><p dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Thank&nbsp;you&nbsp;!</p><p dir=\"auto\">——————————————</p><p dir=\"auto\">租屋流程</p><p dir=\"auto\">⭐️確定地區、照片、簡介內容（是否自己所需）</p><p dir=\"auto\">➡️LINE詢問確認各項條件、觀賞房屋影片</p><p dir=\"auto\">➡️預約看屋</p><p dir=\"auto\">➡️帶看房屋</p><p dir=\"auto\">➡️現場確認所需條件是否吻合</p><p dir=\"auto\">➡️收取斡旋or定金</p><p dir=\"auto\">➡️訂定簽約日期</p><p dir=\"auto\">➡️圓滿成交</p><p dir=\"auto\">⭐️貼心小叮嚀：</p><p dir=\"auto\">1）預約看屋請提前，避免雙方浪費寶貴時間，或趕路危險⚠️</p><p dir=\"auto\">2）各項疑問可透過LINE諮詢</p><p dir=\"auto\">3）走一趟現場，親自體驗房屋空間及現況是否為自己所需</p><p dir=\"auto\">4）成交均收服務費（僅收一次）</p><p dir=\"auto\"></p>\r\n附近有便利商店、傳統市場、百貨公司、公園綠地、學校、醫療機構、夜市。\r\n本房屋近三民高中捷運站。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "蘆洲區三民路26巷", "lat": "25.0824700", "lng": "121.4761627", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "subway", "name": "徐匯中學站", "distance": 447, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約447公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "鷺江國小(三民路)站", "distance": 58, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約58公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "溪墘站", "distance": 110, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約110公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "restaurant", "name": "黑三代目", "distance": 20, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約20公尺"}, {"type": "shop", "name": "橡木桶洋酒蘆洲店", "distance": 167, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約167公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "university", "name": "蘆荻社區大學", "distance": 208, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約208公尺"}, {"type": "secondary", "name": "新北市私立徐匯高級中學附設國中部", "distance": 4